                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 3.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Posadas to Mr. Combs</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Mazatenango</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1903-03-23"><hi rendition="#italic">March 23,
                        1903</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>I thank you kindly for the telegram you had the goodness to send me.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Alberto Posadas.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
